                                                "sense_id": "9f9094b4-d824-3ff7-b531-bee1d5e2d1cc",
                                                "text": "The emergence of this new large-scale lab-based astrophysics was an unanticipated side effect of a much broader, more fraught, and now quite in-the-news scientific journey: the quest for nuclear fusion."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
